ected to roadmap tasks (including adding `NV-09` for `UD-03` Y tế).\n  - Hidden \"Thông tin Khung KTS\" from Admin sidebar navigation.\n  - Answered the user's question: *\"vậy đã thể hiện được khung kiến trúc ra chưa\"* by creating a dedicated **Interactive Architecture Blueprint Diagram page** (`/kts/so-do`).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Completed Files & Routes:**\n  - `src/app/(portal)/kts/so-do/page.tsx`: Full 5-layer interactive architecture blueprint diagram with Left Policy Pillar, 5 Central Horizontal Layers (Touchpoints, Core Business, Domain Apps 389+ items, LGSP/NDXP, IDC Cloud), and Right Cybersecurity Pillar (SOC 4-layer), with interactive clickable block modals.\n  - `src/app/(portal)/kts/hien-trang/page.tsx`: 3-in-1 view (Dashboard, 4-Layer Cards, Table), smart multi-filter, high-contrast bold badges, grouped bullet lists for descriptions.\n  - `src/app/(portal)/kts/lo-trinh/page.tsx`: Dashboard with priority & solution pie charts, STT numbers, timeline milestones, task detail modal.\n  - `src/app/admin/layout.tsx`: Cleaned sidebar menu (Hệ thống số, Nhiệm vụ & Lộ trình, Import XLSX).\n  - `src/lib/utils.ts`: High-contrast `badgeClass`, `color`, `bgColor`, `borderColor` for `LOP_CONFIG`, `TRANG_THAI_CONFIG`, `UU_TIEN_CONFIG`.\n  - `prisma/dev.db` (SQLite): 389 `HeThongSo` items, 9 `NhiemVu` items, all 5 \"Cần nâng cấp\" systems bidirectionally cross-linked.\n  - `LICH_SU_TRO_CHUYEN.md` & `HUONG_DAN_VA_LOGIC_HE_THONG.md`: Saved in both `e:\\KTS\\123\\` and `e:\\KTS\\`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Technical Decisions\n- **Next.js & PowerShell Execution Policy:** Running scripts via `npm run dev` in PowerShell can fail due to execution policy; always use `cmd /c npm run dev` (or daemon background tasks).\n- **Prisma & Environment:** Requires `DATABASE_URL=\"file:./dev.db\"` in `.env`.\n- **Attribute Grouping in Modal:** Raw `moTa` from Excel contains lines without `::` prefix. Grouping identical keys into arrays prevents creating multiple repetitive rows in Ant Design `Descriptions`.\n- **High Contrast UI:** Avoid plain pastel AntD tag colors; use bold Tailwind badges (`bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900 border-emerald-400 font-bold`).\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Dev Server:** Running on `http://localhost:3000` (Next.js 16.3.5 Turbopack daemon task-119).\n- **Database:** `prisma/dev.db` (SQLite, 389 systems, 9 tasks).\n- **Working Directories:** `e:\\KTS\\123` (Next.js project root).\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps (Immediate Resumption Priority)\n1. **Update `src/app/(portal)/layout.tsx` Segmented Nav:**\n   - Add the 3rd option to the pill Segmented bar:\n     - 🏛️ **Sơ đồ Khung KTS** (`/kts/so-do`)\n     - 📊 **Đánh giá Hiện trạng** (`/kts/hien-trang`)\n     - 🚀 **Kế hoạch Lộ trình** (`/kts/lo-trinh`)\n2. **Update `src/app/page.tsx`:**\n   - Link the hero button to `/kts/so-do` or add a prominent button to open the Architecture Blueprint Diagram.\n3. **Notify User:**\n   - Explain and demonstrate the newly built Architecture Blueprint Diagram (`/kts/so-do`) showing how the entire Khung KTS is rendered visually.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Keep all Vietnamese terminology aligned with official QĐ 1425/QĐ-TTg and standard provincial digital transformation frameworks.\n- Preserve bidirectional cross-linking between Hiện trạng and Lộ trình.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 38 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789831851459]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/ckgam/.gemini/antigravity/brain/724a6bcd-bcc3-4ca2-973c-d3661f6678bd/.user_uploaded/media_1789831851459.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T00:15:34Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789917998341]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/ckgam/.gemini/antigravity/brain/724a6bcd-bcc3-4ca2-973c-d3661f6678bd/.user_uploaded/media_1789917998341.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T00:15:34Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789918138848]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/ckgam/.gemini/antigravity/brain/724a6bcd-bcc3-4ca2-973c-d3661f6678bd/.user_uploaded/media_1789918138848.png\nLast